# 默认：自动识别文本文件，统一用 LF 存储
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 批处理必须用 CRLF，否则某些情况下执行异常
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf

# 明确标记为文本的
*.md   text eol=lf
*.js   text eol=lf
*.cjs  text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.css  text eol=lf

# 二进制文件，不做任何换行转换
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.ttf  binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.zip  binary
*.crx  binary
*.pem  binary

# GitHub 语言统计：把这些标为文档，避免影响 JS 占比
*.md linguist-documentation
docs/** linguist-documentation
